    <string name="p1_note_motion">Clear motion in the frame with a still background, to compare ghosting.</string>
    <string name="p1_note_bracket">Backlit room by a window, or buildings against a bright sky.</string>
    <string name="p1_note_night">Dark room with one small lamp, or a night street. The gyroscope decides the shutter and frame count. Braced means leaning on a wall or table.</string>
