    <string name="p1_note_tripod">A tripod, or resting firmly on a stack of books. Static scene with rich texture and both bright and dark areas. About 2 GB per set.</string>
    <string name="p1_note_dark">Cover the main lens completely (finger or black cloth).</string>
    <string name="p1_note_lca">Static high-contrast fine edges filling the frame (window frames, branches against the sky, a full-screen checkerboard).</string>
